        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-07-07T12:57:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, the race window is between line 89 and 94. If we\u0027re hit by the 2nd reset after reset flags are cleared and before HELD_POR is saved, RESET_PIN will be set instead of POWER_ON.",
      "parentUuid": "c7251832_cb95658c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 91,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 94,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "8e6aaac0de7b97c1de3080a54781ad6a23622deb",
